WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:03.680
It was another boring day at Metro City Prison.

2
00:00:03.681 --> 00:00:09.094
Some villains were playing cards.

3
00:00:09.095 --> 00:00:14.391
Mrs. Wiggles grinned. "Looks like I won again!"

4
00:00:14.392 --> 00:00:19.165
The others nodded and tossed their cards in a pile.

5
00:00:19.166 --> 00:00:23.476
"Who wants to play again?" Mrs. Wiggles asked.

6
00:00:23.477 --> 00:00:27.353
​​​​​"I do," said the Electric Elf leader. "Let's play—"

7
00:00:27.354 --> 00:00:30.377
The villains heard a sound like giant footsteps.

8
00:00:30.378 --> 00:00:34.582
Then there was a loud explosion. Boom!

9
