14
00:00:53.467 --> 00:00:58.171
A big claw reached through the hole and pulled the statue out.

15
00:00:58.172 --> 00:01:01.483
The other villains backed away from the hole, but—

16
00:01:01.484 --> 00:01:05.863
zap! Zap! Zap! They turned into statues

17
